<title>USA: Georgia $307 mln GO bonds won by Goldman Sachs.</title>
<headline>Georgia $307 mln GO bonds won by Goldman Sachs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co. said Tuesday it won $307 million Georgia general obligation bonds at a net interest cost of 5.277 percent.</p>
</text>
